Test textures in this directory are modified derivatives of a single
Minetest Game texture, used here to exercise check_package.py's matching
under rotation/flip/hue/edit variations.

Original: mods/default/textures/default_chest_lock.png
Original author: BlockMen
Original license: CC BY-SA 3.0
Source: Minetest Game, see ../mtg_textures/LICENSE.txt and
../mtg_textures/default/README.txt

Derivatives, all CC BY-SA 3.0, same as the original:
  default_chest_lock_flipped_v.png   -- vertically flipped
  default_chest_lock_hushifted_a.png -- hue shifted
  default_chest_lock_majormod.png    -- heavily modified
  default_chest_lock_rotated.png     -- rotated
  default_chest_lock_slightmod.png   -- lightly modified
